110
00:12:13,019 --> 00:12:13,780
[SPEAKER_05]: Those are our friends.

111
00:12:14,320 --> 00:12:15,381
[SPEAKER_04]: Just be quiet.

112
00:12:15,401 --> 00:12:15,841
[SPEAKER_04]: Don't move.

113
00:12:17,442 --> 00:12:20,504
[SPEAKER_04]: Because you know that if you just let the elephant

114
00:12:21,465 --> 00:12:30,649
[SPEAKER_04]: Accept the actual reality, without imposing these extra layers of rationalization over it, then it's gonna run.

115
00:12:31,510 --> 00:12:31,930
[SPEAKER_04]: So...

116
00:12:32,290 --> 00:12:33,891
[SPEAKER_04]: In other words, it hasn't been properly trained.

117
00:12:33,931 --> 00:12:34,771
[SPEAKER_04]: Yeah, exactly.

118
00:12:39,653 --> 00:12:41,614
[SPEAKER_04]: And then, the right knowledge would come out of that.

119
00:12:41,754 --> 00:12:43,075
[SPEAKER_04]: Like, when the mind isn't moved,

120
00:12:44,036 --> 00:13:05,753
[SPEAKER_04]: By anything, like, as the sutta would say, even if violent or kind of aggressive sights, sounds, smells, tastes, touches, not just physical sensations, as people would think, like, I can endure the whatever not sleeping, not eating, not breathing, as the Buddha was doing,

121
00:13:06,333 --> 00:13:16,060
[SPEAKER_05]: No, it's like sights, sounds, smells, thoughts, even, enduring those things on that much more personal level.

122
00:13:16,220 --> 00:13:19,222
[SPEAKER_05]: That's what a tamed mind is able to do.

123
00:13:19,262 --> 00:13:30,330
[SPEAKER_05]: And then, on the basis of those things, you would be able to actually recognize the knowledge that matters, like the Four Noble Truths, which is... None of this was the problem.

124
00:13:30,631 --> 00:13:32,112
[SPEAKER_05]: None of this pressure was the problem.

125
00:13:33,272 --> 00:13:34,754
[SPEAKER_04]: Because now you're able to actually

126
00:13:36,085 --> 00:13:46,191
[SPEAKER_04]: Like, for as long as you're not able to endure it, you won't even be able to direct yourself or to rightly consider the idea that it wasn't the problem.

127
00:13:46,311 --> 00:13:55,536
[SPEAKER_04]: Because the mind will keep constantly kind of putting you on the spot to like, no, no, you have to deal with it, you have to deal with it.

128
00:13:56,317 --> 00:13:59,619
[SPEAKER_05]: Only when it stops and it doesn't care about the pressure anymore.

129
00:14:00,259 --> 00:14:09,324
[SPEAKER_00]: See, that doesn't automatically mean that you will have right knowledge, because some people develop their minds in the suttas without getting the right view.

130
00:14:09,864 --> 00:14:28,475
[SPEAKER_05]: But, if you have the right information and you direct yourself, you direct your mind to that right information, as the suttas would say, of the Four Noble Truths, then you will get to see it, because now it's... now the obstructions that were... like your investment,

131
00:14:30,063 --> 00:14:35,168
[SPEAKER_05]: In wanting to assume that things are otherwise, just so that you can deal with the pressure, now that's gone.

132
00:14:35,828 --> 00:14:44,096
[SPEAKER_00]: So, there's nothing preventing you from seeing the obvious nature of like, oh, no, it's actually... it wasn't the sight, sounds, smells, taste, touches, thoughts, phenomena, nothing.

133
00:14:44,876 --> 00:14:48,019
[SPEAKER_00]: It was just my craving in regard to this whole thing.

134
00:14:48,199 --> 00:14:52,363
[SPEAKER_00]: And then, nothing can bother you again once you see that.

135
00:14:52,723 --> 00:14:53,044
[SPEAKER_00]: So...

136
00:15:27,331 --> 00:15:30,854
[SPEAKER_03]: Is there a place for relaxing?

137
00:15:32,295 --> 00:15:46,385
[SPEAKER_03]: In the sense that, if you're so used to trying to manage the situation, whether through just explaining to yourself, like, no, the pressure is not the problem.

138
00:15:47,286 --> 00:15:52,770
[SPEAKER_03]: Like, everything that you've discussed and learned, and you don't even

139
00:15:54,300 --> 00:15:56,080
[SPEAKER_03]: You don't need to do that.

140
00:15:56,100 --> 00:15:58,421
[SPEAKER_03]: You're just going to enjoy on.

141
00:15:58,441 --> 00:15:59,441
